These restrictions apply even if the Software or Derivative is distributed
without an upfront charge, its source code is published, the distributor is
a nonprofit organization, or the activity has not yet made a net profit.
Publishing source code does not create an exception to this section.

A commercial agreement may specify royalties, fees, permitted activities and
other negotiated terms. This license sets no royalty percentage or payment
